A callable name ending in the word Of or For. Each section is one symbol.
-- hit/doc-comment name=configFor callable --
configFor returns the config a target reads.
-- hit/doc-comment name=valueOf callable --
valueOf reads the value a key holds.
-- hit/doc-comment name=value_of callable --
value_of reads the value a key holds.
-- pass/doc-comment name=parseConfig callable --
parseConfig reads the workspace config.
-- pass/doc-comment name=ForEach callable --
ForEach calls fn on every key.
-- pass/doc-comment name=Offset callable --
Offset returns the byte offset of the key.
-- pass/doc-comment name=valueOf --
valueOf is the value a key holds.
